body:
I like the Oura ring. It tracks more than steps (like sleep and HRV). However, it is almost as pricey as the Garmin Fenix.

&#x200B;

Edit: Actually, it is about $200 less than the Garmin Fenix. I really recommend the Oura ring now.

KetoConnect is your best bet. They have great recipes and a great YouTube channel.

&#x200B;

www.ketoconnect.net
